e been part of the Diamond Orders.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I don't really understand what you're saying. </div> </div> </div>Basically <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/970583-abyssal-imago?p=971430#post971430\">the first historical mage societies were scelesti</a>, and there was a time when mages as a whole were on better terms with the Abyss. Just like the Orders of now may denounce them and the Seers, they weren't always on opposing sides. Potentially they could have been another Order, but the time is off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T13:13:39-08:00","id":1033584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1033427-\u200bpanscrypias-and-keepers-of-the-word-as-dragon-parts-necro?p=1033578#post1033578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's right, but it doesn't say that they left before the Diamond started. Whatever the Seers were, at some point before they became Seers but after they were mages bent around serving the Supernal, could have been part of the Diamond Orders.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, at least to 1E sources, no, Seers as Order <b>could not</b> be found when Diamond started. In <b>Guardians of Veil</b> book you have explicit 'first contact' Diamond done with Seers in early Roman Empire - when Diamond Order <i>were </i>a thing for over one and half century, according to <i>To the Strongest</i> and <b>Mage</b> 2E corebook - and Guardians finding out new enemies, propagated across Roman Empire to proper resistance against Exarchs Servants.<br /> <br /> As Roman Diamond <i>did not</i> know about Seers before, they could not become alliance in Diamond. I.E. Seers could not be <b>DaveB</b>'s mentioned Sixth Diamond Order. I would rather put my money on Pancryptias-Keepers-Mysterium triad in 1300s.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1033427-\u200bpanscrypias-and-keepers-of-the-word-as-dragon-parts-necro?p=1033578#post1033578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Basically <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/970583-abyssal-imago?p=971430#post971430\">the first historical mage societies were scelesti</a>, and there was a time when mages as a whole were on better terms with the Abyss. Just like the Orders of now may denounce them and the Seers, they weren't always on opposing sides. Potentially they could have been another Order, but the time is off.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mages of Kish are long lost and gone by the time of Diamond, living only as Scelesti heresy. They are not Global Order that could be part of Diamond Alliance as we know it from Diamond Percept of Silver Ladder. It would be like saying that Tremere are part of Diamond simply because most heretics of them are part of Diamond Orders officially.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-17-2017, 04:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T13:17:20-08:00","id":1033586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1033427-\u200bpanscrypias-and-keepers-of-the-word-as-dragon-parts-necro?p=1033578#post1033578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's right, but it doesn't say that they left before the Diamond started.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but it implies it, otherwise you'd just say they were an original Diamond Order.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T13:22:49-08:00","id":1033593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1033427-\u200bpanscrypias-and-keepers-of-the-word-as-dragon-parts-necro?p=1033584#post1033584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, at least to 1E sources, no, Seers as Order <b>could not</b> be found before Diamond started. In <b>Guardians of Veil</b> book you have explicit 'first contact' Diamond done with Seers in early Roman Empire - when Diamond Order <i>were </i>a thing for over one and half century, according to To the Strongest and <b>Mage</b> 2E corebook - and Guardians finding out new enemies, propagted across Roman Empire to preper the resistance against Exarchs Servants.<br /> <br /> As Roman Diamond <i>did not</i> know about Seers before, they could not become alliance in Diamond. I.E. Seers could not be <b>DaveB</b>'s mentioned Sixth Diamond Order. I would rather put my money on Pancryptias-Keepers-Mysterium triad in 1300s.</div> </div> </div> </div>The next page it does point out their own history is contradictory, and by Dave's own blog entry on the matter he's pointed out that they've lied about things before. But aside from that, the same section also says, 'Before Rome, the Atlantean orders had encountered cabals that claimed to serve the Exarchs.' The Seers were new, but the idea of serving the Exarchs or other ideas had already existed.<br /> <br /> For what it's worth, I'd guess 'Crown,' 'Heart' or 'Blood' of the Dragon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T13:26:17-08:00","id":1033595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1033427-\u200bpanscrypias-and-keepers-of-the-word-as-dragon-parts-necro?p=1033586#post1033586\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, but it implies it, otherwise you'd just say they were an original Diamond Order.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not if you just wanted to throw it out there. I'm sure you and everyone else has noticed that we're not being told how everything works exactly the way the developers and writers have it.<br /> <br /> I like the world building in the game, and the ideas fans have put together for things, but most of it seems like it's meant to be done at the table. Ambiguity allows you to have the Seers as once a Diamond Order, or a rival since their founding. And frankly, that's how it should be. If they start telling us how it is, that edges out the work at the table, it makes it less a toolbox, and more an encyclopedia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T13:35:56-08:00","id":1033605,"title":"","content":"Oh...the 6th could actually be the Tremere. The Diamond had no clue what their actual nature was for a long time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T23:20:49-08:00","id":1033895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1033427-\u200bpanscrypias-and-keepers-of-the-word-as-dragon-parts-necro?p=1033605#post1033605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh...the 6th could actually be the Tremere. The Diamond had no clue what their actual nature was for a long time.</div> </div> </div> </div>t<br /> <br /> We have a winner.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave 